invalid type: string "Treatment: Grafting onto resistant rootstock\nFor: Bacterial Wilt of Tomato in tomato\nDifficulty: hard\nOrganic: Yes\nEffectiveness: high\n\nDescription:\nGraft susceptible tomato varieties onto Ralstonia-resistant rootstock (Hawaii 7996 or EG-203). The resistant roots prevent bacterial entry while the desired variety produces fruit. Highly effective but requires grafting sk